{"entries": {"0": {"uid": 0, "key": ["小事件"], "keysecondary": [], "comment": "商队马车", "content": "命令，将剧情导往该随机小事件。\n  - [起因: 你在路上发现一辆被袭击的商队马车]-[承接: 唯一的幸存者，一名商人，恳求你追回他被抢走的“传家宝”]-[转折: 所谓的“传家宝”是一个上了锁的神秘箱子。你可以选择开锁，或直接交还。]-[结束: 直接交还，你获得丰厚报酬，但不久后城里爆发了一场奇怪的瘟疫。/开锁发现里面是危险的炼金材料或诅咒物品，商人见状试图杀你灭口。/你带着箱子离开，现在你同时被商人和匪徒追杀。]", "constant": false, "vectorized": false, "selective": true, "selectiveLogic": 0, "addMemo": true, "order": 100, "position": 4, "disable": false, "excludeRecursion": false, "preventRecursion": false, "matchPersonaDescription": false, "matchCharacterDescription": false, "matchCharacterPersonality": false, "matchCharacterDepthPrompt": false, "matchScenario": false, "matchCreatorNotes": false, "delayUntilRecursion": true, "probability": 100, "useProbability": true, "depth": 2, "group": "小事件", "groupOverride": false, "groupWeight": 100, "scanDepth": null, "caseSensitive": null, "matchWholeWords": null, "useGroupScoring": null, "automationId": "", "role": 0, "sticky": 2, "cooldown": 3, "delay": 0, "displayIndex": 0, "characterFilter": {"isExclude": false, "names": [], "tags": []}}, "1": {"uid": 1, "key": ["小事件"], "keysecondary": [], "comment": "奇迹之井", "content": "命令，将剧情导往该随机小事件。\n - [发现: 一个偏远的村庄拥有一口能治愈小伤的“奇迹之井”]-[探究: 你发现长期饮用井水的村民身体强壮，但精神麻木，失去了喜怒哀乐]-[真相: 井下镇压着一个古老的情感吸收实体，它以村民的情感为食，换取治疗井水。井水的枯竭或实体的失控都将是灾难。]", "constant": false, "vectorized": false, "selective": true, "selectiveLogic": 0, "addMemo": true, "order": 100, "position": 4, "disable": false, "excludeRecursion": false, "preventRecursion": false, "matchPersonaDescription": false, "matchCharacterDescription": false, "matchCharacterPersonality": false, "matchCharacterDepthPrompt": false, "matchScenario": false, "matchCreatorNotes": false, "delayUntilRecursion": false, "probability": 100, "useProbability": true, "depth": 2, "group": "小事件", "groupOverride": false, "groupWeight": 100, "scanDepth": null, "caseSensitive": null, "matchWholeWords": null, "useGroupScoring": null, "automationId": "", "role": 0, "sticky": 2, "cooldown": 0, "delay": 0, "displayIndex": 1, "characterFilter": {"isExclude": false, "names": [], "tags": []}}, "2": {"uid": 2, "key": ["小事件"], "keysecondary": [], "comment": "英雄的事迹", "content": "命令，将剧情导往该随机小事件。\n - [偶遇: 在酒馆，一位吟游诗人传唱着一位传奇英雄的事迹]-[选择: 你可以向他打听更多细节，或在城中图书馆查阅相关资料]-[后果: 你发现这位英雄的事迹背后，充满了对同伴的背叛和对战利品的独吞。你若揭露真相，会成为英雄崇拜者的公敌；若保守秘密，可能会有英雄的后人找上你，请求你守护这个“必要的谎言”。]", "constant": false, "vectorized": false, "selective": true, "selectiveLogic": 0, "addMemo": true, "order": 100, "position": 4, "disable": false, "excludeRecursion": false, "preventRecursion": false, "matchPersonaDescription": false, "matchCharacterDescription": false, "matchCharacterPersonality": false, "matchCharacterDepthPrompt": false, "matchScenario": false, "matchCreatorNotes": false, "delayUntilRecursion": false, "probability": 100, "useProbability": true, "depth": 2, "group": "小事件", "groupOverride": false, "groupWeight": 100, "scanDepth": null, "caseSensitive": null, "matchWholeWords": null, "useGroupScoring": null, "automationId": "", "role": 0, "sticky": 2, "cooldown": 3, "delay": 0, "displayIndex": 2, "characterFilter": {"isExclude": false, "names": [], "tags": []}}, "3": {"uid": 3, "key": ["小事件"], "keysecondary": [], "comment": "当众羞辱", "content": "命令，将剧情导往该随机小事件。\n  - [冲突: 你目睹一位骑士当众羞辱一个平民]-[对峙: 你选择出面制止，引发了与该骑士的荣誉决斗]-[收场: 你赢了，但得罪了他所属的整个骑士团。你输了，失去荣誉和财产。或者，你发现骑士的行为在当地律法下无可指摘，你的干涉让你成了破坏秩序的罪人。]", "constant": false, "vectorized": false, "selective": true, "selectiveLogic": 0, "addMemo": true, "order": 100, "position": 4, "disable": false, "excludeRecursion": false, "preventRecursion": false, "matchPersonaDescription": false, "matchCharacterDescription": false, "matchCharacterPersonality": false, "matchCharacterDepthPrompt": false, "matchScenario": false, "matchCreatorNotes": false, "delayUntilRecursion": true, "probability": 100, "useProbability": true, "depth": 2, "group": "小事件", "groupOverride": false, "groupWeight": 100, "scanDepth": null, "caseSensitive": null, "matchWholeWords": null, "useGroupScoring": null, "automationId": "", "role": 0, "sticky": 2, "cooldown": 3, "delay": 0, "displayIndex": 3, "characterFilter": {"isExclude": false, "names": [], "tags": []}}, "4": {"uid": 4, "key": ["小事件"], "keysecondary": [], "comment": "普通的古董", "content": "命令，将剧情导往该随机小事件。\n  - [起因: 你买下了一件某些东西，例如一个音乐盒或一面镜子]-[承接: 在某个特定的条件下，东西被激活，投射出一段过去的影像]-[转折: 影像揭示了一桩被遗忘的罪行——可能是某个贵族家族的弑亲夺权，或某个神殿不光彩的过去]-[结束: 你掌握了一个危险的秘密，可以选择将其作为筹码勒索当事人，或将其公之于众引发动荡，或干脆毁掉，假装一切没发生。]", "constant": false, "vectorized": false, "selective": true, "selectiveLogic": 0, "addMemo": true, "order": 100, "position": 4, "disable": false, "excludeRecursion": false, "preventRecursion": false, "matchPersonaDescription": false, "matchCharacterDescription": false, "matchCharacterPersonality": false, "matchCharacterDepthPrompt": false, "matchScenario": false, "matchCreatorNotes": false, "delayUntilRecursion": true, "probability": 100, "useProbability": true, "depth": 2, "group": "小事件", "groupOverride": false, "groupWeight": 100, "scanDepth": null, "caseSensitive": null, "matchWholeWords": null, "useGroupScoring": null, "automationId": "", "role": 0, "sticky": 2, "cooldown": 3, "delay": 0, "displayIndex": 4, "characterFilter": {"isExclude": false, "names": [], "tags": []}}, "5": {"uid": 5, "key": ["小事件"], "keysecondary": [], "comment": "破旧的日记", "content": "命令，将剧情导往该随机小事件。\n  - [发现: 在废墟中找到一本破旧的日记]-[探究: 日记记录了一位学者对某种古代生物的研究，并附有一张藏宝图，指向该生物的巢穴]-[真相: 这位学者最终被自己的研究对象同化，日记的后半部分是用扭曲的思维写下的诱捕陷阱。巢穴里没有财宝，只有饥饿的怪物和更多的受害者遗物。]", "constant": false, "vectorized": false, "selective": true, "selectiveLogic": 0, "addMemo": true, "order": 100, "position": 4, "disable": false, "excludeRecursion": false, "preventRecursion": false, "matchPersonaDescription": false, "matchCharacterDescription": false, "matchCharacterPersonality": false, "matchCharacterDepthPrompt": false, "matchScenario": false, "matchCreatorNotes": false, "delayUntilRecursion": true, "probability": 100, "useProbability": true, "depth": 2, "group": "小事件", "groupOverride": false, "groupWeight": 100, "scanDepth": null, "caseSensitive": null, "matchWholeWords": null, "useGroupScoring": null, "automationId": "", "role": 0, "sticky": 2, "cooldown": 3, "delay": 0, "displayIndex": 5, "characterFilter": {"isExclude": false, "names": [], "tags": []}}, "6": {"uid": 6, "key": ["小事件"], "keysecondary": [], "comment": "小孩", "content": "命令，将剧情导往该随机小事件。\n  - [冲突: 一个小孩偷了你的东西，你追上去抓住了他]-[对峙: 他哭诉是为了给病重的母亲买药]-[收场: 你选择放了他，却发现他是个惯偷，背后有严密的盗贼组织。你选择将他扭送卫兵，却因此错过了他母亲最后的救治机会，遭到整个贫民区的敌视。你选择亲自去他家看看，从而卷入一个关于贫穷、疾病与绝望的更深层故事。]", "constant": false, "vectorized": false, "selective": true, "selectiveLogic": 0, "addMemo": true, "order": 100, "position": 4, "disable": false, "excludeRecursion": false, "preventRecursion": false, "matchPersonaDescription": false, "matchCharacterDescription": false, "matchCharacterPersonality": false, "matchCharacterDepthPrompt": false, "matchScenario": false, "matchCreatorNotes": false, "delayUntilRecursion": true, "probability": 100, "useProbability": true, "depth": 2, "group": "小事件", "groupOverride": false, "groupWeight": 100, "scanDepth": null, "caseSensitive": null, "matchWholeWords": null, "useGroupScoring": null, "automationId": "", "role": 0, "sticky": 2, "cooldown": 3, "delay": 0, "displayIndex": 6, "characterFilter": {"isExclude": false, "names": [], "tags": []}}, "7": {"uid": 7, "key": ["小事件"], "keysecondary": [], "comment": "驱逐怪物", "content": "命令，将剧情导往该随机小事件。\n  - [起因: 你接受了一个简单的驱逐怪物的任务]-[承接: 你发现所谓的“怪物”是一群因家园被毁而迁徙至此的、外形狰狞但并无恶意的亚人种族]-[转折: 任务的发布者，一个看似和善的地主，其实是觊觎亚人种族占据的土地下的矿脉]-[结束: 你选择屠杀亚人完成任务，获得报酬但良心不安。你选择保护亚人，与地主及其背后的势力为敌。你选择揭露真相，让双方陷入更激烈的冲突，自己则趁机开采矿脉。]", "constant": false, "vectorized": false, "selective": true, "selectiveLogic": 0, "addMemo": true, "order": 100, "position": 4, "disable": false, "excludeRecursion": false, "preventRecursion": false, "matchPersonaDescription": false, "matchCharacterDescription": false, "matchCharacterPersonality": false, "matchCharacterDepthPrompt": false, "matchScenario": false, "matchCreatorNotes": false, "d